# Run output, not artefacts of it. This arm's committed inputs are models/*.xml
# (the scenes, regenerated from rungs.py); everything `python run.py` writes
# under results/ is regenerated by the next run:
#
#   results/*.json         the per-rung reports (mujoco*.json)
#   results/cells/         one dir per rung per run, holding rung 9's
#                          per-replica run records -- each replica is a
#                          separate interpreter and hands its measurement back
#                          through a file
#   results/rung18*/       rung 18's per-cell output and the R5 defaults sweep,
#                          which is explicitly NOT a ladder row
#
# The five committed reports were deleted on 2026-09-02 because nothing cited
# them; a report a doc cites needs `git add -f`.
results/
